      "keyFindings": [
        "Old enough to buy a pack of smokes at the bodega, the Vomero 18 has finally gained some seniority in the swoosh family as it finds itself at the head of the table in the max cushion space of Nike’s 2025 realignment.",
        "The Nike Vomero 18 holds true to its purpose as a max cushion shoe, going above and beyond past versions with a 46 mm of stack height in the heel and 36 mm in the forefoot.",
        "Speaking of cushion, the midsole is a two-layer composite of Nike foams– a thin top layer of the bouncy PEBA-style ZoomX found in models like the Invincible and Vaporfly, and a thick bottom layer of ReactX foam, the same foam found in shoes like the Pegasus 41 and InfinityRN 4."
